    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97602" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκάμνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>labour</i> or <i>suffer with, sympathize with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοῖς πήμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					414
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				1059
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακοῖσι σοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					614
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκαμνούσης [τῇ γαστρὶ] τῆς ζωτικῆς
					δυνάμεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					15.599
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ψυχὴ] συννοσεῖ [τῷ σώματι] καὶ
					συγκάμνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.137d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>work with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				987
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				9.1075.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(v A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇδε χθονί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					396
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕν μοι . . σύγκαμε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HF</u>
					1386
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πολλά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					8.14.9
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				988
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκαμὼν δορί</span>
			<i>with</i> the spear, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				326
			</span></i>.</div>
